Subject: tls: drop core module declarations on WASIX
Last-Update: 2026-09-27

The statically linked WebAssembly build already owns the module API symbols.
Do not ask the TLS translation unit to emit a second core-module copy.

diff --git a/src/tls.c b/src/tls.c
index 35685e8..b47f336 100644
--- a/src/tls.c
+++ b/src/tls.c
@@ -27,7 +27,9 @@
  * POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.
  */
 
+#ifndef __wasm__
 #define VALKEYMODULE_CORE_MODULE /* A module that's part of the server core, uses server.h too. */
+#endif
 
 #include "server.h"
 #include "connhelpers.h"
